  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Support to End TB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Vietnam (GVN) aims to end TB by 2030, working through its National TB Program (NTP). USAID, through this USAID Support to End Tuberculosis Activity, will support the GVN to achieve this goal through targeted technical assistance to the NTP, provincial health management authorities, TB service networks, as well as other key local stakeholders in priority provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
